# Open Observability Framework — Prometheus Pull Metrics Queries
# Target: local Prometheus TSDB (default loopback listen: http://127.0.0.1:9090)
#
# Distinguishing zero connections from scrape failure and missing samples:
#   - Active connections (healthy):  up{job="cloudflared"} == 1 AND cloudflared_tunnel_ha_connections{job="cloudflared"} > 0
#   - Zero connections (healthy):    up{job="cloudflared"} == 1 AND cloudflared_tunnel_ha_connections{job="cloudflared"} == 0
#   - Scrape failure (timeout/5xx/malformed/refused): up{job="cloudflared"} == 0 (metric sample absent)
#   - Metric missing (HTTP 200 without metric):       up{job="cloudflared"} == 1 AND absent(cloudflared_tunnel_ha_connections{job="cloudflared"}) == 1
#   - Collector down / no scrapes yet:                absent(up{job="cloudflared"}) == 1

# 1. Latest active HA connection count (returns 0 when connected count is zero; empty on scrape failure or missing metric)
cloudflared_tunnel_ha_connections{job="cloudflared"}

# 2. Scrape health (1 = last scrape succeeded, 0 = timeout / HTTP error / malformed response / connection error)
up{job="cloudflared"}

# 3. Explicitly detect zero active connections while scraping succeeded (distinguished from failure/missing)
(cloudflared_tunnel_ha_connections{job="cloudflared"} == 0) and on(job) (up{job="cloudflared"} == 1)

# 4. Explicitly detect scrape failure (timeout, HTTP error, malformed exposition, unreachable target)
up{job="cloudflared"} == 0

# 5. Explicitly detect metric missing despite a successful HTTP 200 scrape
absent(cloudflared_tunnel_ha_connections{job="cloudflared"}) and on(job) (up{job="cloudflared"} == 1)
